  <!-- ============================================================
       Common card layout (3 tiles horizontal):
       canvas 1920 x 1080
       padding: 80 left/right + 60 top
       card width: ~ 570, gap 18, card height: ~ 800 (top section 380 + footer)
       ============================================================ -->

  <!-- ============================================================
       Page A — シンプル footer リボン
